### Get all employer supervisors
GET {{host}}/employer/supervisors
Authorization: {{employer_token}}

### Employer update user profile
PUT {{host}}/user/profile_update/employer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{employer_token}}

{
  "firstName": "Updated Firstname",
  "vision": "To be the best behaved in conduct and morals now updated",
  "mission": "Somewhere in the south"
}